WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.380
Two roots this week mean light.

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:05.060
One came from Latin, one from Greek.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:09.260
Then long words about books, built from parts you already know.

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:14.760
In the lantern game, build each word from its parts, and watch the lantern light up.
